      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I was looking to post this after the post today mentioning \"We're planning to distribute all SDK updates solely via the VRChat Creator Companion starting in 2023.\" If VRCCC is gonna need to be used going forward in 2023, it NEEDS to have better options to sort. At least on par with Unity Hub though IDEALLY like you suggested you can sort it beyond that Avatars, Worlds, ETC.",
